# Artifact bytes are hashed, not their line endings. Without this, a checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true rewrites committed JSON, JSONL, YAML, Markdown and
# generated Python to CRLF, and every artifact_hashes entry stops matching.
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.safetensors binary
*.parquet binary
